19:21:18'),(619,'Free Yoga On The Promenade','free-yoga-on-the-promenade-june-24-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-06-24',NULL,'Free','7:00 PM','8:00 PM','On Monday, June 24th, starting at 7:00 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Grab your mat and head into Piedmont Park every fourth Monday of the month at 7pm for Free Yoga in the Promenade. This outdoor opportunity is presented by Sprouts and hosted by the Piedmont Park Conservancy.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/free-yoga-on-the-promenade/2019-06-24/',NULL,'2019-06-24 20:33:05','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(621,'Free Workout: Hiit (High Intensity Interval Training) With Northside Hospital','free-workout-hiit-high-intensity-interval-training-with-northside-hospital-june-29-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-06-29',NULL,'Free','8:00 AM','9:00 AM','On Saturday, June 29th, starting at 8:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Join Piedmont Park Conservancy Sponsor Northside Hospital at the Active Oval for a free high-intensity interval exercise program. Make sure to bring a water bottle, mat and get ready to sweat 💪. \n\n\n\nSaturday, June 29\nSaturday, July 27\nSaturday, August 31\n\n\n\nTime: 8am-9am \nLocation: Piedmont Park - North Soccer Field 2 at the Active Oval \nBenefits include: \n\n\n\nFast results\nFat Loss\nMuscle tone\nCardio\n\n\n\nLearn more about Northside Hospital at: sportsmedicine.northside.com',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/free-workout-hiit-high-intensity-interval-training-with-northside-hospital/2019-06-29/',NULL,'2019-06-24 20:39:17','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(622,'Sweat And Splash (Fitness Class)','sweat-and-splash-fitness-class-june-29-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-06-29',NULL,'N/A','8:30 AM','10:00 AM','On Saturday, June 29th, starting at 8:30 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Participate in this unique and awesome opportunity to workout at Piedmont Park\'s pool! \nThis 90 minute strength building, core sculpting, heart pumping pool workout is perfect for the reaching your fitness goals! Be prepared for for a circuit-training, total-body class for the first 45 minutes of class (wear tennis shoes). Please bring swimwear for the second half of class. \n8 WEEK SERIES\nSaturdays, June 1-July 27 (No class June 22)\n8:30am to 10:00am\n*August 3rd is a possible makeup date, if needed \nLocation: Piedmont Park Aquatic Center \n1 Class - $30 \n\nRegistration: https://apm.activecommunities.com/piedmontpark/Activity_Search/sweat-and-splash-2019-1-class/610\n\n8 Classes - $210 \n\nRegistration: https://apm.activecommunities.com/piedmontpark/Activity_Search/sweat-and-splash-2019-8-classes/611',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/sweat-and-splash-fitness-class/2019-06-29/',NULL,'2019-06-24 20:39:21','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(623,'Green Market (Local Farmers Market)','green-market-local-farmers-market-june-29-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-06-29',NULL,'Free','9:00 AM','1:00 PM','On Saturday, June 29th, starting at 9:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Voted one of the top five farmer\'s markets in Atlanta byAccess Atlanta, Green Market encourages sustainable communities in the most basic way - by providing shoppers with direct access to local farmers and small businesses. Come walk the market and enjoy the fun every Saturday from9 am - 1 pm. \nEnjoy local farmers, bakers, jams, preserves and artisan goods. There is something for everyone. While you shop, you can enjoy prepared foods and drinks for breakfast and lunch. The market features local live music, chef demonstrations and a board-certified dietitian will be demonstrating on health and wellness utilizing market produce. The market also provides a kid-friendly activity center for those with small children.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/green-market-3/2019-06-29/',NULL,'2019-06-24 20:39:24','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(628,'Sweat And Splash (Fitne