arting at 7:00 PM, with bands including Seth Walker.','',0,1,'provider',0,0,0,'http://www.ticketfly.com/event/1874699',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:06:55','2019-08-18 19:37:41'),(1056,'Matthew Mayfield','matthew-mayfield-october-18-2019-music-eddies-attic',7,1,1,2,'2019-10-18',NULL,'$12 - $15','9:15 PM','12:15 AM','See live music at Eddie\'s Attic on Friday, October 18th. Starting at 9:15 PM, with bands including Matthew Mayfield.','',0,1,'provider',0,0,0,'http://www.ticketfly.com/event/1872944',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:03','2019-08-18 19:37:44'),(1057,'Movies On The Promenade: When Harry Met Sally','movies-on-the-promenade-when-harry-met-sally-august-15-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-08-15',NULL,'N/A','8:00 PM','10:00 PM','On Thursday, August 15th, starting at 8:00 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Join the Piedmont Park Conservancy on August 15 for a special screening of When Harry Met Sally. There will be food and beverages available for purchase at the event. Bring a blanket and chairs, and enjoy an evening under the stars! \nThe event starts at 8:00 pm and the movie will begin around 8:30 pm. \nGet your free tickets here. \nPlease view rules for Movies on the Promenade here. \nThank you to The Kendeda Fund. \n \n \n \n \n \nThis program is supported in part by the Mayor\'s Office of Cultural Affairs.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/movies-on-the-promenade-when-harry-met-sally',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:12','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(1058,'Free Tai Chi At Green Market','free-tai-chi-at-green-market-august-17-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-08-17',NULL,'Free','8:45 AM','9:45 AM','On Saturday, August 17th, starting at 8:45 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Join the Piedmont Park Conservancy for complimentary Tai Chi classes in Piedmont Park! The classes will be offered near the Green Market and the Visitor\'s Center on Saturday mornings from 8:45-9:45am. \nBring a water bottle and comfortable clothing for this relaxing experience! Finish your visit to Piedmont Park by enjoying food, produce, live music and moreat the Green Market! \nThank you to Kaiser Permanente for presenting this free opportunity at the Green Market! \nAbout the Instructor: \n \nGrace Zhao learned authentic Tai Chi from the top Tai ChiGrand Masters in China. She took Qi Gong private training from Grand Master Wu Bin, the renowned International Martial Arts Coach for Jet Li, and received Health Qi Gong Certification from the Chinese National Health Qi Gong Association in Beijing China. She has reviewed three major Chinese martial arts schools through visiting and learning from the roots: WuDang, ShaoLin, and ErMei. \nGrace Zhao conducted academic research on Traditional Chinese Medicine (TCM) in graduate and doctoral Cross-cultural Study programs and has received Wellness Certification from the Academy of Chinese Medical Sciences. \nAs the MingWellness Founder &amp; President and the Managing Director of MingWellness Tai Chi Academy, Grace Zhao has been partnering with Kaiser Permanente for the past five years in providing Tai Chi instructor resources to Kaiser\'s Healthy Living program in Metro Atlanta. In her prior professional career, she was an experienced corporate executive and management consultant working for Fortune 100 companies. She holds an MBA in Marketing from Syracuse University and completed the Executive Healthcare Education program at Kellogg School of Management.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/tai-chi-at-green-market-2/2019-08-17',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:16','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(1059,'Homeschool Day','homeschool-day-august-20-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-08-20',NULL,'N/A','10:00 AM','12:00 PM','On Tuesday, August 20th, starting at 10:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Homeschool Day is back for 2019! Beginning on August 20, each month we will host a Homeschool Day with a unique program for varying grade levels. \nLearn More',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/homeschool-day-5',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:20','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(1060,'Member Pollinator Talk & Tour','member-pollinator-talk-amp-tour-august-24-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-08-24',NULL,'N/A','9:00 AM','11:00 AM','On Saturday, August 24th, starting at 9:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Join the Piedmont Park Conservancy for a Pollinator Talk &amp; Tour on Saturday, August 24. Enjoy coffee and pastries while learning about the importance of pollinators and then visit the Invesco beehives in the Park. This event is open to all Members and their family. RSVP to hreed@piedmontpark.org.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/member-pollinator-talk-tour',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:23','2020-03-17 01:57:00'),(1061,'Atl Wine + Spirits Fest 2019','atl-wine-spirits-fest-2019-august-24-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-08-24',NULL,'N/A','6:00 PM','10:00 PM','On Saturday, August 24th, starting at 6:00 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Come join us on August 24, 2019 from 6pm-10pm as we travel through several different regions spanning the globe. Attendees will be able to drink wine, beer and spirits specific to certain regions. Restaurants will also have food available for purchase. Take a break from your travels and enjoy the soothing sounds of live music. The World Tour will be held on the lovely Promenade at Piedmont Park. Proceeds will go to benefit the Piedmont Conservancy. \nTicket includes 4 hours of samples from 100+ wine, beer and spirits featured at the event\nATL Wine + Spirits Fest is a rain or shine event and no refunds will be given. \nEvent website: https://www.atlwineandspiritsfest.com/ \nIf you would like to volunteer for this event, click here.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/atl-wine-spirits-fest-2019',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:27','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(1062,'Festival Peachtree Latino','festival-peachtree-latino-august-25-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,1,'2019-08-25',NULL,'N/A','7:00 AM','8:00 PM','On Sunday, August 25th, starting at 7:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Rafael Ortega \nHmg.rafaelortega@gmail.com \nDescription: Annual multicultural event \nPiedmont Park',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/city-permit-festival-peachtree-latino',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:30','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(1063,'Free Yoga On The Promenade','free-yoga-on-the-promenade-august-26-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-08-26',NULL,'Free','7:00 PM','8:00 PM','On Monday, August 26th, starting at 7:00 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Grab your mat and head into Piedmont Park every fourth Monday of the month at 7pm for Free Yoga. This outdoor opportunity is hosted by the Piedmont Park Conservancy.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/free-yoga-on-the-promenade/2019-08-26',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:34','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(1064,'Hope For The Homeless 5K/10K Challenge','hope-for-the-homeless-5k10k-challenge-august-30-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-08-30',NULL,'N/A','6:30 AM','9:30 AM','On Friday, August 30th, starting at 6:30 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Temeko Richardson \ntemeko@runlifescourse.com \nDescription: 5K/10K run/walk to benefit Atlanta\'s local charity \"Back on My Feet\" and Grady High School\'s Athletic department',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/city-permit-hope-for-the-homeless-5k-10k-challenge',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:38','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(1065,'Free Workout: Hiit (High Intensity Interval Training) With Northside Hospital','free-workout-hiit-high-intensity-interval-training-with-northside-hospital-august-31-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-08-31',NULL,'Free','8:00 AM','9:00 AM','On Saturday, August 31st, starting at 8:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Join Piedmont Park Conservancy Sponsor Northside Hospital at the Active Oval for a free high-intensity interval exercise program. Make sure to bring a water bottle, mat and get ready to sweat \n\n\n\nSaturday, June 29\nSaturday, July 27\nSaturday, August 31\n\n\n\nTime: 8am-9am \nLocation: Piedmont Park - North Soccer Field 2 at the Active Oval \nBenefits include: \n\n\n\nFast results\nFat Loss\nMuscle tone\nCardio\n\n\n\nLearn more about Northside Hospital at: sportsmedicine.northside.com',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/free-workout-hiit-high-intensity-interval-training-with-northside-hospital-3/2019-08-31',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:41','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(1066,'Green Market (Local Farmers Market)','green-market-local-farmers-market-august-31-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-08-31',NULL,'N/A','9:00 AM','1:00 PM','On Saturday, August 31st, starting at 9:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Voted one of the top five farmer\'s markets in Atlanta byAccess Atlanta, Green Market encourages sustainable communities in the most basic way - by providing shoppers with direct access to local farmers and small businesses. Come walk the market and enjoy the fun every Saturday from9 am - 1 pm. \nEnjoy local farmers, bakers, jams, preserves and artisan goods. There is something for everyone. While you shop, you can enjoy prepared foods and drinks for breakfast and lunch. The market features local live music, chef demonstrations and a board-certified dietitian will be demonstrating on health and wellness utilizing market produce. The market also provides a kid-friendly activity center for those with small children.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/green-market-3/2019-08-31',NULL,'2019-08-12 19:07:45','2019-08-21 18:01:57'),(1067,'Party For Piedmont Park','party-for-piedmont-park-september-5-2019-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2019-09-05',NULL,'N/A','6:30 PM','10:30 PM','On Thursday, September 5th, starting at 6:30 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Every year, Party guests 