me. \nLove You Healthy Fitness,led by Fitness Expert Saidah Jones, CSCS, offers a rotating sequence of classes throughout the year. Piedmont Park Conservancy members receive 20% off class fees. \nRegister here.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-2/2020-03-07',NULL,'2020-03-06 23:46:30','2020-03-06 23:46:30'),(1781,'Phoenix Flies Tour In Piedmont Park','phoenix-flies-tour-in-piedmont-park-march-7-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-07',NULL,'N/A','10:00 AM','11:30 AM','On Saturday, March 7th, starting at 10:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Tours are led by dedicated volunteers with years of experience researching the history of the park and conducting tours. Please dress for the elements and wear comfortable walking shoes. Tours may be canceled in the event of inclement weather. Meet at the 12th Street and Piedmont Avenue park entrance. Please note that the Conservancy does not validate parking. \nRSVP,Monday-Friday only, totours@piedmontpark.orgor\n404-875-7275. ext. 242.\n\nFor more information visithttps://www.piedmontpark.org/sightseeing-and-tours/',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/phoenix-flies-tour-in-piedmont-park',NULL,'2020-03-06 23:46:43','2020-03-06 23:46:43'),(1782,'2020 Kidfit Strong Fitness Challenge','2020-kidfit-strong-fitness-challenge-march-8-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-08',NULL,'N/A','11:00 AM','7:00 PM','On Sunday, March 8th, starting at 11:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Howard Daniel \nkidfitstrongatlanta@kidfitstrong.com \nDescription: Keeping kids active and healthy \nLocation: Piedmont Park \n\n\n\n\nKEEPING KIDS ACTIVE AND HEALTHY!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe KIDFITSTRONG Fitness Challenge is the nations largest mobile fitness event traveling from coast-to-coast dedicated to keeping kids active and healthy. At the KIDFITSTRONG Fitness Challenge, kids of all ages get the opportunity to flex their physical fitness by participating in a completion-based obstacle course designed to challenge speed, strength, agility and overall physical fitness. The event is FREE to the public and features a variety of activities for the whole family to enjoy including active gaming fun for all ages and on-site programming designed to inspire kids and families to live a more active and healthy lifestyle! \n\n\n\n\n*EVENT PENDING PERMIT*',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/city-permit-2020-kidfit-strong-fitness-challenge',NULL,'2020-03-06 23:47:05','2020-03-06 23:47:05'),(1783,'Love You Healthy Fitness: Hardcore Abs','love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-march-11-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-11',NULL,'N/A','6:00 PM','7:00 PM','On Wednesday, March 11th, starting at 6:00 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Tighten your tummy, improve your posture and get that six-pack! This Piedmont Park abs class will focus on everything core and more. Bring a yoga mat. All fitness levels are welcome. \nLove You Healthy Fitness,led by Fitness Expert Saidah Jones, CSCS, offers a rotating sequence of classes throughout the year. Piedmont Park Conservancy members receive 20% off class fees. \nRegister here.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs/2020-03-11',NULL,'2020-03-06 23:47:21','2020-03-06 23:47:21'),(1784,'Love You Healthy Fitness: Hardcore Abs','love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-march-14-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-14',NULL,'N/A','9:00 AM','10:00 AM','On Saturday, March 14th, starting at 9:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Tighten your tummy, improve your posture and get that six-pack! This Piedmont Park abs class will focus on everything core and more. Bring a yoga mat. All fitness levels are welcome. \nLove You Healthy Fitness,led by Fitness Expert Saidah Jones, CSCS, offers a rotating sequence of classes throughout the year. Piedmont Park Conservancy members