rk abs class will focus on everything core and more. Bring a yoga mat. All fitness levels are welcome. \nLove You Healthy Fitness,led by Fitness Expert Saidah Jones, CSCS, offers a rotating sequence of classes throughout the year. Piedmont Park Conservancy members receive 20% off class fees. \nRegister here.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-2/2020-04-11',NULL,'2020-03-06 23:52:26','2020-03-06 23:52:26'),(1803,'Pull For Piedmont','pull-for-piedmont-april-16-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-04-16',NULL,'N/A','6:00 PM','7:30 PM','On Thursday, April 16th, starting at 6:00 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Join us in making Piedmont Park a more beautiful place! With 200+ acres to care for, we need your help to enhance and maintain Atlanta\'s favorite greenspace for the more than 4 million people who visit it each year. This fun event is more than just a volunteer opportunity, it\'s a chance to make a positive impact on the Park while connecting with fellow Park enthusiasts. Sign up now to help with a garden or park clean-up project, then reward yourself at a gathering in the Park featuring a beverage. We will meet in the Welcome Plaza, located outside the bottom entrance of the Sage parking garage. \nRSVP \nFor more information, click here.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/pull-for-piedmont-4',NULL,'2020-03-06 23:52:44','2020-03-06 23:52:44'),(1804,'Atlanta Dogwood Festival','atlanta-dogwood-festival-april-17-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-04-17','2020-04-19','N/A','12:00 PM','6:00 PM','On Friday, April 17th, starting at 12:00 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','The Atlanta Dogwood Festival \nwww.dogwood.org \ncoordinator@dogwood.org \nEVENT DESCRIPTION: The 84th Annual Atlanta Dogwood Festival is an Atlanta Tradition that takes place during the Spring. \nThree (3) Day Event: 4/17/2020 - 12:00PM - 11:00PM; 4/18/2020 - 10:00AM - 11:00PM; 4/19/2