nizer:Mike Fisher paul.fisher@nmss.org \nDescription: Annual walk to raise awareness and funds for NMSS. \nLocation: Piedmont Park - Atlanta, GA \n**Event Permit Pending**',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/city-permit-walk-ms-atlanta-2',NULL,'2020-03-12 02:33:04','2020-03-12 02:33:04'),(2194,'Green Market (Local Farmers Market)','green-market-local-farmers-market-april-25-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-04-25',NULL,'N/A','9:00 AM','1:00 PM','On Saturday, April 25th, starting at 9:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Voted one of the top five farmer\'s markets in Atlanta byAccess Atlanta, Green Market encourages sustainable communities in the most basic way - by providing shoppers with direct access to local farmers and small businesses. Come walk the market and enjoy the fun every Saturday from9 am - 1 pm. \nEnjoy local farmers, bakers, jams, preserves and artisan goods. There is something for everyone. While you shop, you can enjoy prepared foods and drinks for breakfast and lunch. The market features local live music, chef demonstrations and a board-certified dietitian will be demonstrating on health and wellness utilizing market produce. The market also provides a kid-friendly activity center for those with small children. \nIf it is raining Green Market will be held in the Community Center. Dogs are welcome.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/green-market-local-farmers-market-2020-04-04/2020-04-25',NULL,'2020-03-12 02:33:05','2020-03-17 02:20:58'),(2195,'Love You Healthy Fitness: Hardcore Abs','love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-april-25-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-04-25',NULL,'N/A','9:00 AM','10:00 AM','On Saturday, April 25th, starting at 9:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Tighten your tummy, improve your posture and get that six-pack! This Piedmont Park abs class will focus on everything core and more. Bring a yoga mat. All fitness levels are welcome. \nLove 