nes, CSCS, offers a rotating sequence of classes throughout the year. Piedmont Park Conservancy members receive 20% off class fees. \nRegister here.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-2020-03-18',NULL,'2020-03-17 02:20:24','2020-03-17 02:20:24'),(2532,'Canceled: Love You Healthy Fitness: Hardcore Abs','canceled-love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-march-21-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-21',NULL,'N/A','9:00 AM','10:00 AM','On Saturday, March 21st, starting at 9:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Tighten your tummy, improve your posture and get that six-pack! This Piedmont Park abs class will focus on everything core and more. Bring a yoga mat. All fitness levels are welcome. \nLove You Healthy Fitness,led by Fitness Expert Saidah Jones, CSCS, offers a rotating sequence of classes throughout the year. Piedmont Park Conservancy members receive 20% off class fees. \nRegister here.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-2-2020-03-21',NULL,'2020-03-17 02:20:27','2020-03-17 02:20:27'),(2533,'Canceled: Phoenix Flies Tour In Piedmont Park','canceled-phoenix-flies-tour-in-piedmont-park-march-21-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-21',NULL,'N/A','10:00 AM','11:30 AM','March 14th\'s Phoenix Flies Tours are canceled. \nFor future tours, please visit https://www.piedmontpark.org/sightseeing-and-tours/','March 14th\'s Phoenix Flies Tours are canceled. \nFor future tours, please visit https://www.piedmontpark.org/sightseeing-and-tours/',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/phoenix-flies-tour-in-piedmont-park-2/2020-03-21',NULL,'2020-03-17 02:20:31','2020-03-17 02:20:31'),(2534,'Canceled 2020 Atlanta Science Festival Exploration Expo','canceled-2020-atlanta-science-festival-exploration-expo-march-21-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-21',NULL,'N/A','11:00 AM','4:00 PM','On Saturday, March 21st, starting at 11:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Canceled - See event website for further details.\nhttps://atlantasciencefestival.org/covid19/ \n \n2020 Atlanta Science Festival Exploration Expo\nSaturday, March 21 (11 am - 4 pm) at Piedmont Park \nAtlanta\'s biggest interactive science event is FREE and open to adults, families, and children of all ages and interests. Touch a human brain! Build biological machines! Show off your craziest socks on the Giant Traveling Map of Georgia! Look inside a jet engine! Draw with 3-D pens! Taste miracle berries! Meet predators, parasites, and pollinators! Pen your own science haiku! Stare down an owl! Build a marsh or freeze a marshmallow! Measure how loud your mom is! \nWith more than 100 hands-on, interactive science booths from local organizations, universities, and companies, we\'ll be showing off Atlanta science at this year\'s Exploration Expo. \nMore info: https://atlantasciencefestival.org/expo/ \n___ \nCity Permit Holder: Cynthia Alford\ncalford@destinationsouth.com',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/city-permit-2020-atlanta-science-festival-exploration-expo',NULL,'2020-03-17 02:20:34','2020-03-17 02:20:34'),(2535,'Canceled: Free Yoga In Piedmont Park','canceled-free-yoga-in-piedmont-park-march-23-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-23',NULL,'Free','6:30 PM','8:00 PM','On Monday, March 23rd, starting at 6:30 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','The Piedmont Park Conservancy is hosting free yoga every fourth Monday of the month (excludes November and December)! Grab your mat and head over to Piedmont Park. Sign-in begins at 6:30 pm and yoga starts at 7 pm.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/free-yoga-in-piedmont-park-2020-02-24-2020-03-23',NULL,'2020-03-17 02:20:40','2020-03-17 02:20:40'),(2536,'Canceled: Homeschool Day: Animal Olympics','canceled-homeschool-day-animal-olympics-march-24-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-24',NULL,'N/A','10:00 AM','2:00 PM','On Tuesday, March 24th, starting at 10:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Join the Piedmont Park Conservancy for our 2020 Homeschool Day series. Two sessions will be held, one for K-5th grade &amp; one for middle/high schoolers. For program details, exact times and contact information, click here. \nHomeschool Day is held inside the Community Center. For directions, click here. \nREGISTER TODAY',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/homeschool-day-animal-olympics',NULL,'2020-03-17 02:20:44','2020-03-17 02:20:44'),(2537,'Canceled: Love You Healthy Fitness: Hardcore Abs','canceled-love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-march-25-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-25',NULL,'N/A','6:00 PM','7:00 PM','On Wednesday, March 25th, starting at 6:00 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Tighten your tummy, improve your posture and get that six-pack! This Piedmont Park abs class will focus on everything core and more. Bring a yoga mat. All fitness levels are welcome. \nLove You Healthy Fitness,led by Fitness Expert Saidah Jones, CSCS, offers a rotating sequence of classes throughout the year. Piedmont Park Conservancy members receive 20% off class fees. \nRegister here.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-2020-03-25',NULL,'2020-03-17 02:20:48','2020-03-17 02:20:48'),(2538,'Postponed: Green Market (Local Farmers Market)','postponed-green-market-local-farmers-market-march-28-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-03-28',NULL,'N/A','9:00 AM','1:00 PM','On Saturday, March 28th, starting at 9:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Voted one of the top five farmer\'s markets in Atlanta byAccess Atlanta, Green Market encourages sustainable communities in the most basic way - by providing shoppers with direct access to local farmers and small businesses. Come walk the market and enjoy the fun every Saturday from9 am - 1 pm. \nEnjoy local farmers, bakers, jams, preserves and artisan goods. There is something for everyone. While you shop, you can enjoy prepared foods and drinks for breakfast and lunch. The market features local live music, chef demonstrations and a board-certified dietitian will be demonstrating on health and wellness utilizing market produce. The market also provides a kid-friendly activity center for those with small children. \nIf it is raining Green Market will be held in the Community Center. Dogs are welcome.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/green-market-local-farmers-market',NULL,'2020-03-17 02:20:51','2020-03-17 02:20:51'),(2539,'Free Yoga In Piedmont Park','free-yoga-in-piedmont-park-april-27-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-04-27',NULL,'Free','6:30 PM','8:00 PM','On Monday, April 27th, starting at 6:30 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','The Piedmont Park Conservancy is hosting free yoga every fourth Monday of the month (excludes November and December)! Grab your mat and head over to Piedmont Park. Sign-in begins at 6:30 pm and yoga starts at 7 pm. \nFebruary\'s yoga will be held in Magnolia Hall.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontpark.org/event/free-yoga-in-piedmont-park-2020-02-24/2020-04-27',NULL,'2020-03-17 02:21:11','2020-03-17 02:21:11'),(2540,'Love You Healthy Fitness: Hardcore Abs','love-you-healthy-fitness-hardcore-abs-april-29-2020-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2020-04-29',NULL,'N/A','6:00 PM','7:00 PM','On Wednesday, April 29th, starting at 6:00 PM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Tighten your tummy, improve your posture and get that six-pack! This Piedmont Park abs class will focus on everything core and more. Bring a yoga mat. All fitness levels are welcome. \nLove You Healthy Fitness,led by Fitness Expert Saidah Jones, CSCS, offers a rotating sequence of classes throughout the year. Piedmont Park Conservancy members receive 20% off class fees. \nRegister here.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://www.piedmontp