rsday, April 23rd, starting at 11:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','The Landmark Luncheon is Piedmont Park Conservancy\'s signature fundraising event--and the largest annual gathering in support of Atlanta\'s most beloved park. \nEach spring, hundreds of civic, corporate, and community leaders come together to celebrate Piedmont Park and invest in its future. Proceeds from the Landmark Luncheon directly support the Conservancy\'s work to preserve, protect, and enhance the Park for generations to come. \nThe 2026 Landmark Luncheon will build on the incredible momentum of past years, spotlighting bold ideas, shared stewardship, and the enduring role Piedmont Park plays in the life of our city. Guests can expect an inspiring program, meaningful connection, and a renewed sense of what\'s possible when Atlanta comes together on behalf of this special place.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://piedmontpark.org/event/24393',NULL,'2026-02-20 01:28:49','2026-02-20 01:28:49'),(2957,'Weekly Walking Club','weekly-walking-club-april-28-2026-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2026-04-28',NULL,'N/A','10:00 AM','10:45 AM','On Tuesday, April 28th, starting at 10:00 AM. Go check out this event at Piedmont Park!','Join the Conservancy and fellow park fans for a weekly group walk in Piedmont Park! \nEvery Tuesday, we host a 45-minute walk on Tuesdays at 10am. Each walk will feature different popular paths while answering any questions you may have about Piedmont Park or the Conservancy. \nFor questions, please contact Kaycee Walker at programs@piedmontpark.org. \nMeet in front of Dockside near the 12th gate entrance, five minutes prior to departure. Walk up, no RSVP required.',0,1,'provider',0,1,0,'https://piedmontpark.org/event/weekly-walking-club-3/2026-04-28',NULL,'2026-02-20 01:28:51','2026-02-20 01:28:51'),(2958,'Weekly Walking Club','weekly-walking-club-may-5-2026-other-piedmont-park',8,1,5,2,'2026-05-05',NULL,'N/A','10:00 AM','10:45 AM','On Tuesday, May 5th, starting at 1